    // 4000 tokens: Qwen3.6 35B needs up to 2000 tokens for chain-of-thought thinking
    // before producing actual output. The /no_think prefix in the prompt suppresses
    // thinking on Qwen3 models; 4000 is a safety net when that fails.
    chat_completion_with_tokens(client, model, prompt, 4000)
